Sanka monorepo — per-component licensing
================================================

This repository contains packages under different licenses. The
SPDX-License-Identifier header in each source file is authoritative.

  packages/sanka-migrate/src/sanka/runtime/       AGPL-3.0-only
  packages/sanka-migrate/src/sanka/cli/           AGPL-3.0-only
  packages/sanka-migrate/src/sanka/_client.py     AGPL-3.0-only
  packages/sanka-migrate/src/sanka/connector/     AGPL-3.0-only compatibility shim
  packages/sanka-migrate-mcp/                      Apache-2.0
  scripts/, tests/, docs/                          Apache-2.0

The `sanka-migrate` wheel contains only AGPL runtime code and depends on the
separately distributed Apache-2.0 `sanka-connector-sdk`. The SDK and first-party
providers live at https://github.com/sankaHQ/sanka-connectors.

Runtime code that Sanka owns or otherwise has permission to relicense is also
available under a commercial license from Sanka, Inc. for use without
AGPL-3.0 obligations — see docs/legal/commercial-license.md (draft).

Contributions use the license applicable to the files they modify. No
Contributor License Agreement is required; see CONTRIBUTING.md.
